# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Renders and stills — large (60MB+) and reproducible from src + public/audio.
out/

# Music beds. Regenerate with `node scripts/score.mjs`; deterministic, so a
# regenerated stem is byte-identical to the one any render used.
public/score/

# Generated by `node scripts/check.mjs`. Derived from narration.json, and churns
# on every timing change.
REVIEW.md

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   public/audio/  — narration MP3s. Only ~1.4MB, but ~20 minutes of synthesis
#                    against the TTS server to rebuild, and they must stay in
#                    lockstep with src/audio-manifest.json or every cue is wrong.
#   src/audio-manifest.json — measured durations and cue offsets. The whole
#                    project's timing derives from it.
